{"id":"vod_sn_37138","vodId":"37138","provider":"sn","providerName":"索尼资源","type":2,"name":"魔侦探洛基 RAGNAROK","name_cn":"魔侦探洛基 RAGNAROK","date":"2003-01-01","year":"2003","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://snzypic.vip/upload/vod/20230911-1/416a91184ebe81ab196ca9d3259abc1f.jpg"},"summary":"故事发生在一间名为“燕雀”的侦探社之中，坐镇其中的，是名为洛基（樱井孝宏 配音）的美少年侦探。虽然表面上看来只是一个小孩子，但洛基的真身其实是北欧神话中的邪神，因为作恶多端而被放逐人间，在此期间陪伴着洛基，照料他饮食起居的，是原型为一条巨蟒的暗野龙介（三木真一郎 配音）。　　一次偶然中，一个名为大堂寺茧良（堀江由衣 配音）在无意之间闯入了燕雀侦探社之中，她希望洛基能够帮助她替一个会说话的洋娃娃找到曾经的主人。一番波折之后，事件总算顺利解决，而在此之后，茧良竟然自说自话地成为了洛基的助手，两人一同面对的，是各式各样科学难以解释的灵异事件。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-09-11 15:49:08","playable":true,"episodeCount":28,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"snm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/fR6kS4WBTc1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/E4gGfqZwKf1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/YHZzaJmcRQ1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/jN1rTK1yer1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/X1hvGqdzF71/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/aCty2B477S1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/xcwAA5P8x41/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/fTBb0rYZJf1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/KnzwiWkC8n1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/spzfSLG9JB1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/k2pKAgr29H1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/8XDquLbXYX1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/pW94U8JD681/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第14集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/TFMrMfTXL71/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第1